<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>LPO form to confirm your order — offer OFR-2026-0003</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f4f7;font-family:Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#f1f4f7;padding:24px 12px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:580px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(20,30,40,.07)\"><tr><td style=\"background:#00796B;padding:18px 26px\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.4px\">ITEC Cargo Ltd</span><span style=\"display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px\">Logistics Management System</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:26px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#18222c;font-weight:700\">Local Purchase Order form</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\">Dear Diane Uwase,</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\">Thank you for accepting our offer OFR-2026-0003. We are pleased to be working with you.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\">To confirm the order, please find attached our Local Purchase Order (LPO) form. Our company details, the agreed routes and prices, and the terms are already filled in.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\"><strong>Please complete the shaded boxes:</strong></p><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px\"><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#33404c\">Your LPO number and date</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#33404c\">Your company details (please check the ones we have filled in)</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#33404c\">The quantity and the amount for each service, and the total</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#33404c\">The goods, the collection date and the delivery details</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#33404c\">Who our invoices should be sent to</li><li style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#33404c\">The names of the people authorising the order, with their <strong>signatures and your company stamp</strong></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\">The form can be filled in on a computer or phone with any PDF reader (Adobe Reader, Chrome or Edge), or printed and filled in by hand. Please send it back by reply to this email (admin@itec.rw), quoting OFR-2026-0003. A scan or a photo of the signed form is enough.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\">Once we receive it, we will confirm the collection date, the truck and the driver.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#33404c\">Kind regards,<br>Admin User, ITEC Cargo Ltd<br>+250 788 000 001  ·  admin@itec.rw</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 26px;background:#f7f9fb;border-top:1px solid #e9edf1\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#8a949e\">ITEC Cargo Ltd  ·  KN 5 Rd, Kiyovu, Kigali, Rwanda  ·  +250 788 000 111  ·  info@iteccargo.test  ·  TIN 100123456</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#9aa4ad\">Powered by ITEC LTD &copy; 2026</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>','Local Purchase Order form\n\nDear Diane Uwase,\n\nThank you for accepting our offer OFR-2026-0003. We are pleased to be working with you.\n\nTo confirm the order, please find attached our Local Purchase Order (LPO) form. Our company details, the agreed routes and prices, and the terms are already filled in.\n\nPlease complete the shaded boxes:\n\n- Your LPO number and date\n- Your company details (please check the ones we have filled in)\n- The quantity and the amount for each service, and the total\n- The goods, the collection date and the delivery details\n- Who our invoices should be sent to\n- The names of the people authorising the order, with their signatures and your company stamp\n\nThe form can be filled in on a computer or phone with any PDF reader (Adobe Reader, Chrome or Edge), or printed and filled in by hand. Please send it back by reply to this email (admin@itec.rw), quoting OFR-2026-0003. A scan or a photo of the signed form is enough.\n\nOnce we receive it, we will confirm the collection date, the truck and the driver.\n\nKind regards,\nAdmin User, ITEC Cargo Ltd\n+250 788 000 001  ·  admin@itec.rw\n\nITEC Cargo Ltd  ·  KN 5 Rd, Kiyovu, Kigali, Rwanda  ·  +250 788 000 111  ·  info@iteccargo.test  ·  TIN 100123456\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026','[{\"filename\":\"LPO-form-OFR-2026-0003.pdf\",\"path\":\"price_offers/lpo-forms/LPO-form-OFR-2026-0003.pdf\"}]','price_offers','OFR-2026-0003','sent','01a1013a-0ae1-7bc8-b44e-43029d1c8f18',NULL,1,'2026-10-03 12:05:42','2026-10-03 10:05:39'),(124,'n-6ac0d5d9dcca32.94654715-u2','notification','aline@itec.rw','Aline Mukamana',NULL,NULL,2,'Transport request approved','<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Transport request approved</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f4f7;font-family:Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;background:#f1f4f7;padding:24px 12px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:580px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2