able></td></tr></table></body></html>','Clearing instruction\n\nDear Joseph Kamanzi,\n\nPlease find below our clearing instruction for the load below at Malaba (transit, Uganda). The documents we hold are attached.\n\nThe goods\n\nOur reference  |  SHP-2026-0005 / BDR-2026-0004\nImporter  |  Rwanda Solar Supplies Ltd, TIN 112233445\nImporter address  |  KG 9 Ave, Nyarutarama\nReceiver  |  Diane Uwase +250 788 220 114\nGoods  |  Solar panels and inverters, 1 × 40 ft container\nPackages / weight / volume  |  600 packages · 18,000 kg · 60 m³\nDeclared value  |  USD 96,000.00\nCustomer order (LPO)  |  LPO-RSS-2026-0412\nBill of lading  |  MAEU 245678901\nContainer / seal  |  MSKU 4821936 (40ft) · seal ML-KE 0458821\nTruck and driver\n\nTruck / trailer  |  RAD 482 K / trailer RL 4821\nDriver  |  Samuel Niyonzima, +250 788 632 119\nTrip  |  TRP-2026-0006: Mombasa Port (Kilindini), Kenya to ITEC Kigali Main Warehouse, Kigali\nLast reported at  |  Kampala, Uganda (overnight), 3 Oct 18:32\nThe clearance\n\nBorder post  |  Malaba\nCustoms country  |  Uganda\nDirection  |  Transit\nTruck at the border  |  arrived 3 Oct 2026, 18:06\nPlease:\n\n- Lodge the declaration and arrange the bond before the truck reaches the border.\n- Reply to this email with the declaration number and any amount to be paid, with its assessment.\n- Send us the receipts and the release as soon as customs releases the truck.\n\nOur driver, Samuel Niyonzima will contact your person at the border (+250 788 632 119).\n\nKind regards,\nAline Mukamana, Head of Operations, ITEC Cargo Ltd\n+250 788 202 020  ·  aline@itec.rw\n\nITEC Cargo Ltd  ·  KN 5 Rd, Kiyovu, Kigali, Rwanda  ·  +250 788 000 111  ·  info@iteccargo.test  ·  TIN 100123456\nPowered by ITEC LTD (c) 2026','[{\"filename\":\"Packing-list-PL-SZ-2026-0917.pdf\",\"path\":\"shipment_documents/20261003-124102-be6a5d534545.pdf\"},{\"filename\":\"Customs-declaration-C-2026-KE-778812.pdf\",\"path\":\"shipment_documents/20261003-124129-90dd7b977d8c.pdf\"},{\